{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/a606684a4290819124a5bfa3024a67f0.poster.avif?t=1764133056\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/a606684a4290819124a5bfa3024a67f0.webm?t=1764133056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/a606684a4290819124a5bfa3024a67f0.mp4?t=1764133056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A unique blend of gameplay has fans saying it is, &quot;<i>Re-Defining A Genre.</i>&quot;</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After letting his girlfriend down for the last time, Billy is swiftly dumped on his two-year anniversary. While walking home alone in the rain, a mysterious portal swallows him up and spits him out on a distant alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is here that Billy will learn to become the dependable person he should have always been.<br>Oh, and save the world, too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/da844faad25a710a4edec1af14548cf4.poster.avif?t=1764133056\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/da844faad25a710a4edec1af14548cf4.webm?t=1764133056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/da844faad25a710a4edec1af14548cf4.mp4?t=1764133056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Billy Saves the World</strong> gives players ultimate freedom: You can head straight to the end for a more challenging experience or you can explore the 2D open-world to find  upgrades, dozens of NPCs, and puzzles that will help you on your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean toward action platforming or solve puzzles -- whichever you prefer, to get it done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/9c97ff5efcb957651b9e837312c11d8b.avif?t=1764133056\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring\u00a0<strong>5 to 20+ hours</strong> of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contains one of the year's best soundtracks</strong>, composed by John McMillan (Assassin's Creed IV: Black Flag) and multi-platinum producer Tom Ratesic (Nicki Minaj, Lil Wayne). And audio by Jonathan Beres (Game of Thrones).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your dialogue in this comedic sci-fi love story that appears silly on the surface but offers a meaningful message of personal growth &amp; acceptance, written by <strong>award-winning filmmaker, Cooper Bibaud.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.poster.avif?t=1764133056\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.webm?t=1764133056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.mp4?t=1764133056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, Slide, Jump, Rocket-Boost, Wall-Jump, and use Jedi-like super powers</strong> to explore a dense 2D metroidvania-style open world, featuring 7+ diverse biomes with beautifully hand drawn environments and animation from top film &amp; tv professionals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve over <strong>25 side-quests</strong> with multiple dialogue branches, solutions and outcomes based on what you say and do. Packed with <strong>30+ optional levels to beat</strong>, each containing different routes<strong>,</strong> unique enemies, deadly traps, creative puzzles, secret collectibles, and nail biting time trials.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Join the official Discord channel for the latest news &amp; announcements, chat directly with the creator, PLUS receive exclusive videos, images, WIPs and more.</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/02533f6f19b9d8bde4e8c03e6b929492.avif?t=1764133056\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gaming 101","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1390420/fa123e9fc6d4253f029db63112087b568c28626c.jpg"},{"name":"And The Oscar Goes To...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1390420/060bd162b28f662bd2d203132e281412193eeedf.jpg"},{"name":"Attention to Detail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1390420/8f31ef9a5a280feebfbf2be74d2edb010a531b2d.jpg"},{"name":"A Certain Time, A Certain Place","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1390420/f86a14dc3f293670e3fe8132c83d6a957573b52b.jpg"},{"name":"Casual Spelunker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1390420/6af29c1486e34abc35fa76ec59318b2d206ba66d.jpg"},{"name":"Casual Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1390420/c4fba1e201f26ea0cf6f70e2f77a5a4050b05bed.jpg"