width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring\u00a0<strong>5 to 20+ hours</strong> of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contains one of the year's best soundtracks</strong>, composed by John McMillan (Assassin's Creed IV: Black Flag) and multi-platinum producer Tom Ratesic (Nicki Minaj, Lil Wayne). And audio by Jonathan Beres (Game of Thrones).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your dialogue in this comedic sci-fi love story that appears silly on the surface but offers a meaningful message of personal growth &amp; acceptance, written by <strong>award-winning filmmaker, Cooper Bibaud.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.poster.avif?t=1764133056\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.webm?t=1764133056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.mp4?t=1764133056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, Slide, Jump, Rocket-Boost, Wall-Jump, and use Jedi-like super powers</strong> to explore a dense 2D metroidvania-style open world, featuring 7+ diverse biomes with beautifully hand drawn environments and animation from top film &amp; tv professionals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve over <strong>25 side-quests</strong> with multiple dialogue branches, solutions and outcomes based on what you say and do. Packed with <strong>30+ optional levels to beat</strong>, each containing different routes<strong>,</strong> unique enemies, deadly traps, creative puzzles, secret collectibles, and nail biting time trials.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Join the official Discord channel for the latest news &amp; announcements, chat directly with the creator, PLUS receive exclusive videos, images, WIPs and more.</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/02533f6f19b9d8bde4e8c03e6b929492.avif?t=1764133056\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p>","developers":["Midnight Paw Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/header.jpg?t=1764133056","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240 or AMD A10-5800K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 550 Ti or AMD Radeon HD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240 or AMD A10-5800K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 550 Ti or AMD Radeon HD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (Intel only)<br></li><li><str